    "ThemeLoader.parse starts with empty current selectors and ignores property lines until a [selector] header. The original local theme had no header, so its properties were ignored.",
    "ThemeLoader accepts [*] for defaults and raw hexadecimal [chapter ID] for IDSelector. # prefixes select tags, not IDs.",
    "QuestTheme.get(property, object) tries the object and then getParentID until an ancestor provides the property.",
    "QuestButton.draw passes the quest object to all four quest state color properties and tints the outline; it also draws status icons.",
